      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel.\n\nPick up from the hotel and private transfer to La Paz airport for flight to Uyuni (flight not included).\n\nArrival in Uyuni and visit of the Train Cemetery. Transfer to Colchani village to observe the salt processing activity and learn about the extraction process.\n\nEntrance to the Salar de Uyuni. Visit of the Ojos del Salar and Playa Blanca (Salt Hotel Museum). Visit of Incahuasi Island, located in the middle of the salt flat, where giant cacti and a panoramic 360° view of the salt desert can be appreciated.\n\nContinuation to the north area of the salt flat to visit a local museum with pre-Columbian mummies and the viewpoint at the foot of the Tunupa Volcano.\n\nReturn to Colchani."
    },
